4. ATTRIBUTION AND CITATION
=========================================================================
Academic citation of theorem names/statements under (A) is permitted and
encouraged. Example BibTeX:

  @misc{ParrWesterhoff2026PvsNP,
    title  = {Shared Foundation for P vs NP: Σ→Σ*→L→M→Run→T→P/NP→≤p→SAT→3SAT},
    author = {Parr, Ahmad Ali and Westerhoff, Jessica},
    year   = {2026},
    howpublished = {\url{https://github.com/SNAPKITTYWEST/CLAY-INSTITUTE-P-VS-NP}},
    note   = {Fingerprint SDC-Ω-∂-2026-PVSNP; CC BY 4.0 for mathematical content}
  }

Forking on GitHub does not grant license beyond viewing (§3.B). The
mathematical fingerprint in SovereignFingerprint.lean (F(53)%107=8, π(108)=72,
Zeckendorf 64=55+8+1) establishes provenance.

